+# Tasks
+
+1. Add a red regression that packs and installs the root package, runs
+   `forge --version`, and runs `forge setup --quick --yes` in a fresh Git repo.
+2. Route root runtime imports through the internal package names and bundle the
+   three workspaces with npm's native bundled-dependency support.
+3. Advance release metadata to beta.7 and run focused, package, security, and
+   full validation before shipping one hotfix PR.
